"333fcb51-0bbe-5fd1-abf3-582272445148" :question/math-academy-id "q-17255" :question/is-example false :question/problem "Given that $f(x)=11{e}^{x}+8{x}^{2}-12x-20$, find the slope of the tangent at $x=0.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the addition and the power rules, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(11{e}^{x}+8{x}^{2}-12x-20) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(11{e}^{x})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(8{x}^{2})-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(12x)-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(20) \\\\  & =11\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({e}^{x})+8\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{2})-12\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x)-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(20) \\\\  & =11{e}^{x}+8(2x)-12(1)-0 \\\\  & =11{e}^{x}+16x-12.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope of the tangent at $x=0$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=0} & ={(11{e}^{x}+16x-12)|}_{x=0} \\\\  & =11{e}^{0}+16\\cdot 0-12 \\\\  & =11\\cdot 1+0-12 \\\\  & =11-12 \\\\  & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-17255/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8b7d0153-6e0a-5e19-83f1-960811dc5205"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-17255"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-17388/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" :answer/id #uuid "cbfc7296-a450-5ed8-a358-2c4347a0d850" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-17388/selection/81019cafd5e6b9d9a1c9b06ca1543d9d449776cdd152d56c8789c9863bbc8e35" :answer/id #uuid "58f52d14-95ee-582b-bab5-a83eedbbf36c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "ln⁡3+5e" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-17388/selection/7f96cae8a95984ca975d9ef9429fd8046782cc83661be963647181bdde05f09e" :answer/id #uuid "edad8190-417a-5069-b8e2-977076c2e1f1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "ln⁡3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-17388/selection/3619ce3d1169244e6fc22eb6701e62f51530bb3d025643e84c91daed44affce4" :answer/id #uuid "a8ceeea3-9d41-55e5-b584-5aeb99474063" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "ln⁡3+5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-17388/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "f68449a8-1439-54b6-9112-9b071eadd874" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-17388/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "e5c9bfd2-6e1c-5078-86fc-2bbc3906ccd5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-17388/selection/3619ce3d1169244e6fc22eb6701e62f51530bb3d025643e84c91daed44affce4" :answer-field/choices ["q-17388/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" "q-17388/selection/81019cafd5e6b9d9a1c9b06ca1543d9d449776cdd152d56c8789c9863bbc8e35" "q-17388/selection/7f96cae8a95984ca975d9ef9429fd8046782cc83661be963647181bdde05f09e" "q-17388/selection/3619ce3d1169244e6fc22eb6701e62f51530bb3d025643e84c91daed44affce4" "q-17388/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-17388" :question/id #uuid "d4297003-d87d-50b1-8d62-c56588831177" :question/math-academy-id "q-17388" :question/is-example false :question/problem "Given that $f(x)={3}^{x}+5{e}^{x}$, find the instantaneous rate of change at $x=0.$" :question/worked-solution "Applying the formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({3}^{x}+5{e}^{x}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({3}^{x})+\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}(5{e}^{x}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({3}^{x})+5\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}({e}^{x}) \\\\  & ={3}^{x}ln⁡3+5{e}^{x}\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the instantaneous rate of change at $x=0$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=0} & ={({3}^{x}ln⁡3+5{e}^{x})|}_{x=0} \\\\  & ={3}^{0}ln⁡3+5{e}^{0} \\\\  & =1\\cdot ln⁡3+5\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =ln⁡3+5.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-17388/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "14e68965-6c39-5947-ac05-eee99e685063"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-17388"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-11735/selection/a8fc0d4a126fe9fb7f7ceffc8ea470037b2952fe50817aa632f23e74f423599a" :answer/id #uuid "1173697c-4512-545e-8a09-fc54613d0bab" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{6}^{x}-10x+6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-11735/selection/880bc73b6d9535f2aa42a8bfd441cb2d0e4ea4f217262cdce8fa2b3caefa0517" :answer/id #uuid "ab81de42-b3fe-573e-8bc1-7ab5a95c11a3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{6}^{x}-10{x}^{2}+6x-19" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-11735/selection/1d879ad2269bc8d94ad5156a68b84deee2b5058ae28c58cefb206554e1a8536b" :answer/id #uuid "b33c4381-902e-578b-9646-52b7678e06f9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{6}^{x}ln⁡6-10x+6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-11735/selection/ce0256632431dbe554cbfe3dc94b8e1f184e7730b36a99dfdae6175e78c47b32" :answer/id #uuid "57a7c55e-bee9-5aa3-b1f8-c42909909914" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{6}^{x}ln⁡6-10{x}^{2}+6x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-11735/selection/319d75f7ecbf7a43fcfede547010db1f626ae88f22f5cedd262757ac6f054631" :answer/id #uuid "982123d8-6562-543f-aa63-9d0edda6abd9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{6}^{x}ln⁡6-10{x}^{2}+6x-19" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-11735/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "0f95d7b7-b698-552f-81b3-d35214e77069" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-11735/selection/1d879ad2269bc8d94ad5156a68b84deee2b5058ae28c58cefb206554e1a8536b" :answer-field/choices ["q-11735/selection/a8fc0d4a126fe9fb7f7ceffc8ea470037b2952fe50817aa632f23e74f423599a" "q-11735/selection/880bc73b6d9535f2aa42a8bfd441cb2d0e4ea4f217262cdce8fa2b3caefa0517" "q-11735/selection/1d879ad2269bc8d94ad5156a68b84deee2b5058ae28c58cefb206554e1a8536b" "q-11735/selection/ce0256632431dbe554cbfe3dc94b8e1f184e7730b36a99dfdae6175e78c47b32" "q-11735/selection/319d75f7ecbf7a43fcfede547010db1f626ae88f22f5cedd262757ac6f054631"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-11735" :question/id #uuid "6695fa0f-c166-510d-bef5-83f050a38203" :question/math-academy-id "q-11735" :question/is-example false :question/problem "Given that $f(x)={6}^{x}-5{x}^{2}+6x-19$, find ${f}^{′}(x).$" :question/worked-solution "Applying the formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({6}^{x}-5{x}^{2}+6x-19) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({6}^{x})-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(5{x}^{2})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(6x)-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(19) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({6}^{x})-5\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{2})+6\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x)-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(19) \\\\  & =ln⁡6\\cdot {6}^{x}-5(2x)+6(1)-0 \\\\  & ={6}^{x}ln⁡6-10x+6.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-11735/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "14e68965-6c39-5947-ac05-eee99e685063"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-11735"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-340280/field-1/9d967547e9d66847ec96774d679ffc35b4d502f495907ab7fadf3ba2ac274a81" :answer/id #uuid "bd968646-fada-522e-ab8b-cd5144563887" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\ln(5)+4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340280/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "d56c8b7d-74e1-5fbc-8f1e-b74aa93f489a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-340280/field-1/9d967547e9d66847ec96774d679ffc35b4d502f495907ab7fadf3ba2ac274a81" :answer-field/choices ["q-340280/field-1/9d967547e9d66847ec96774d679ffc35b4d502f495907ab7fadf3ba2ac274a81"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-340280" :question/id #uuid "47e3375b-0473-5a59-80e0-5aae3fa936ba" :question/math-academy-id "q-340280" :question/is-example false :question/problem "Given that $f(x)={5}^{x}-6{x}^{3}+4x-1$, the slope of the tangent at $x=0$ is{{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "Applying the formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({5}^{x}-6{x}^{3}+4x-1) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({5}^{x})-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(6{x}^{3})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4x)-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(1) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({5}^{x})-6\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{3})+4\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x)-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(1) \\\\  & =ln⁡(5)\\cdot {5}^{x}-6(3{x}^{2})+4(1)-0 \\\\  & =ln⁡(5)\\cdot {5}^{x}-18{x}^{2}+4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope of the tangent at $x=0$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=0} & ={(ln⁡(5)\\cdot {5}^{x}-18{x}^{2}+4)|}_{x=0} \\\\  & =ln⁡(5)\\cdot {5}^{0}-18(0)^{2}+4 \\\\  & =ln⁡(5)\\cdot 1-0+4 \\\\  & =ln⁡(5)+4.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-340280/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "14e68965-6c39-5947-ac05-eee99e685063"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-340280"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-304038/field-1/174bd8205fb5f36b54e895b1d646bf9942f7c11f0ff6a0b862ba72430b0a3f66" :answer/id #uuid "bc271ec7-0efc-54b3-9115-2685575056a3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\cdot8^x\\ln(8)+12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-304038/field-1/1c46e99580b6e788cd79922446af0f4717d92d7aceb008d0566e452e014b9c76" :answer/id #uuid "41681629-b813-58d0-8acb-d3d785c357f9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\cdot8^x+12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-304038/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "e6936770-a4e5-5a11-9389-0331d0fdaf38" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-304038/field-1/174bd8205fb5f36b54e895b1d646bf9942f7c11f0ff6a0b862ba72430b0a3f66" :answer-field/choices ["q-304038/field-1/174bd8205fb5f36b54e895b1d646bf9942f7c11f0ff6a0b862ba72430b0a3f66" "q-304038/field-1/1c46e99580b6e788cd79922446af0f4717d92d7aceb008d0566e452e014b9c76"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-304038" :question/id #uuid "bd96388d-6f15-569f-bc11-b254a12e45eb" :question/math-academy-id "q-304038" :question/is-example false :question/problem "Given that $f(x)=3\\cdot {8}^{x}+12x+10$, find ${f}^{′}(x).$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Applying the formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3\\cdot {8}^{x}+12x+10) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3\\cdot {8}^{x})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(12x)+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(10) \\\\  & =3\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({8}^{x})+12\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x)+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(10) \\\\  & =3(ln⁡(8){8}^{x})+12(1)+0 \\\\  & =3ln⁡(8){8}^{x}+12.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-304038/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "14e68965-6c39-5947-ac05-eee99e685063"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-304038"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-340272/field-1/435997d907fdf9de09d60c7ff7a205cde547bbca5da2392eeb263bcb7ee112c2" :answer/id #uuid "8207df72-93c7-50e0-bcb5-dbdae30fcbbb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2\\cdot8^x\\ln(8)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340272/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "1cc4d6ae-8842-5ede-8272-2da4e9cb9751" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-340272/field-1/435997d907fdf9de09d60c7ff7a205cde547bbca5da2392eeb263bcb7ee112c2" :answer-field/choices ["q-340272/field-1/435997d907fdf9de09d60c7ff7a205cde547bbca5da2392eeb263bcb7ee112c2"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-340272" :question/id #uuid "c6327cee-2232-53ac-b90a-ea5e68bca1f1" :question/math-academy-id "q-340272" :question/is-example false :question/problem "Given that $f(x)=7-2\\cdot {8}^{x}$, find ${f}^{′}(x).$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Applying the formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(7-2\\cdot {8}^{x}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(7)-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2\\cdot {8}^{x}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(7)-2\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({8}^{x}) \\\\  & =0-2(ln⁡(8){8}^{x}) \\\\  & =-2ln⁡(8){8}^{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-340272/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "14e68965-6c39-5947-ac05-eee99e685063"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-340272"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
